step.instructions:
Runs tsocmd LISTGRP for each group in: ${instance-RACF_GROUPS}
PASS : All groups found (LISTGRP RC=0) FAIL : One or more groups not found
Missing groups may indicate the Zowe security configuration jobs have not been run, or a previous cleanup removed them.

Writes the health report to ${instance-REPORT_PATH}.
The report records: - Timestamp and system context from z/OSMF - Configuration used (thresholds, groups checked) - Overall health verdict: ${instance-HEALTH_STATUS}
Retain for operational records or forward to the system support team.
